+    tested BOTH the live-verified prefix AND the full proposed fix: the
+    first 209 actions replay cleanly to level=5,
+    state=GameState.NOT_FINISHED (matches the session''s own report
+    exactly), but the FULL 221-action sequence INCLUDING the proposed
+    column-3 fix also DIES -- GameState.GAME_OVER, level=0. The
+    proposed fix does NOT work; the real safe descent route from
+    (3,12) after switch 3 remains genuinely unsolved. No new level
+    banked; frontier stays at level 5. Next attempt should NOT retry
+    this exact column-3 substitution -- it is now a confirmed dead end
+    too -- and should instead search for a genuinely different descent
+    path from (3,12), or investigate whether switch 3 needs to be
+    clicked from a different position/timing before descending.'
